218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Speech Emotion Recognition \(SER\) serves as the bridge between functional AI and emotionally aware AI. By enabling machines to perceive and respond to human emotions, we can expand the role of AI into traditionally human-centric fields such as therapy, education, entertainment, and even conflict resolution. This creates a deeper, more meaningful synergy between humans and machines.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
