<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Speech emotion is complex and varies by individual. The same sentence can express joy, sarcasm, or sadness depending on tone, pitch, and tempo. We want to solve that challenge.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
